description=Action writes the Ubuntu boot set stored on linux_rootfs into slot A (init_boot_a, vendor_boot_a, boot_a), verifies it and reboots. No images bundled. © 2026 yzddmr6 · https://github.com/yzddmr6/xiaomipad-8pro-mainline
